        "quote": "Defendant also submitted an affidavit from its janitorial supervisor, who stated that in accordance with the established maintenance schedule, he checked the laundry room floor three times on the day of the accident and found that it was clean and dry ( see Pagan v New York City Hous. Auth. , 121 AD3d 622 [1st Dept 2014]). Furthermore, defendant's claims representative stated that for the three-month period before the date of the accident, no complaints were lodged relating to water on the floor of the laundry room.",
        "statement_status": "testimony_or_record"
