        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "At trial, the plaintiffs presented evidence that their decedent, who died after sustaining a severe head injury in a fall, slipped and fell on a patch of ice located upon the defendants’ property. However, the defendants presented certain evidence indicating that the decedent’s injuries were the result of a fall at his home.",
